iso_3166_1":"SE","title":"Skräckens gränd","type":"reissue title"},{"iso_3166_1":"TR","title":"Doktor Jekyll","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"GB","title":"Doctor Jekyll and Sister Hyde","type":"trailer title"},{"iso_3166_1":"GB","title":"Doctor Jekyll & Sister Hyde","type":"video box title"},{"iso_3166_1":"GB","title":"Dr. Jekyll & Sister Hyde","type":"video box title"},{"iso_3166_1":"GB","title":"Dr. Jekyll and Sister Hyde","type":"DVD title"},{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"Dr. Jekyll and Sister Hyde","type":"Blu-Ray title"},{"iso_3166_1":"PT","title":"A Bela e o Monstro","type":""}],"externalIds":{"imdb_id":"tt0068502","wikidata_id":"Q1747465","facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":[{"id":10125,"name":"mad scientist"},{"id":11315,"name":"sex change"},{"id":8250,"name":"victorian england"},{"id":9826,"name":"murder"},{"id":156033,"name":"jekyll and hyde"},{"id":173010,"name":"evil woman"},{"id":252596,"name":"victorian era"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"FR","release_dates":[{"certification":"12","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1975-05-21T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"GB","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1971-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","type":3},{"certification":"15","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"en","note":"DVD","release_date":"2010-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","type":5},{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"2017-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","type":5}]},{"iso_3166_1":"PT","release_dates":[{"certification":"M/18","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Barcelos","release_date":"1975-03-07T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"US","release_dates":[{"certification":"PG","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1972-03-31T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"","overview":"In foggy London Dr Jekyll experiments on newly deceased women determined to discover an elixir for immortal life. Success enables his spectacular transformation into the beautiful but psychotic Sister Hyde who stalks the dark alleys of Whitechapel for young, innocent, female victims, ensuring continuation of the bloodstained research. With each transformation Sister Hyde becomes the more dominant personality, determined to eventually suppress the frail, ineffectual Dr Jekyll forever.","tagline":"PARENTS: Be sure your children are sufficiently mature to witness the intimate details of this frank and revealing film."},{"iso_639_1":"it","iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","title":"Barbara il mostro di Londra","overview":"Cercando di creare il siero dell'eterna giovinezza, il dottor Henry Jekyll - che per le sue ricerche si serve di ormoni prelevati dai cadaveri di ragazze ventenni - giunge invece a realizzarne uno che, sperimentato su se stesso, lo trasforma in donna, anche se per brevi periodi.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Dr. Jekyll & Schwester Hyde","overview":"Der junge Dr. Jekyll  ist wohl genau das, was man ein Arbeitstier nennt. Unter vollkommener Isolation arbeitet er mit weiblichen Hormonen von frischen Leichen an einem Elixier fürs ewige Leben. Er testet das Elixier an sich selbst und schon verwandelt er sich in eine Frau. Ms. Hyde ist geboren, doch für weitere Experimente braucht Dr.Jekyll noch mehr Leichen und solangsam leeren sich die Strassen des englischen Dörfchens. Als Scotland Yard Verdacht an Jekyll schöpft, verwandelt er sich in Ms. Hyde, doch die dominiert bald schon Jekylls Persönlichkeit. Sie begeht nun einen Mord nach dem anderen und versucht, die Kontrolle an sich zu reißen...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"Dr. Jekyll y su hermana Hyde","overview":"El Dr Jekyll experimenta en mujeres recién fallecidas, determinado a descubrir un elixir para la inmortalidad. En sus investigaciones, fabrica un brebaje que le convierte en una hermosa mujer, que se hace pasar por su hermana Hyde, y que se dedica a asesinar mujeres jóvenes para, de ese modo, poder continuar sus investigaciones como Jekyll. Sin embargo, con cada transformación, la hermana Hyde se convierte en la personalidad más dominante, dispuesta a suprimir al Dr. Jekyll para siempre.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"","overview":"Le docteur Jekyll, réalisant que la science avance trop lentement à son goût, se dit qu'il est possible de trouver un moyen d'allonger la vie. Les résultats ne seront pas vraiment ceux qu'il recherchait…","tagline":"PARENTS: Assurez-vous que vos enfants sont suffisamment mûrs pour être témoins des détails intimes de ce film franc et révélateur."},{"iso_639_1":"hu","iso_3166_1":"HU","name":"Magyar","english_name":"Hungarian","title":"","overview":"Robert Louis Stevenson regényének számtalan adaptációja létezik, a mi kedvencük mégis ez a WTF verzió, melyben Jekyll doktor egy nővé változik, akiről kiderül, hogy egyébként ő Hasfelmetsző Jack is...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"","overview":"Dr. Henry Jekyll is een ambitieuze geleerde die dag en werkt aan een serum dat alle ziekten geneest en mensen onsterfelijk zou maken. Hij komt tot de vaststelling dat vrouwelijke hormonen hierbij kunnen helpen. Eén van zijn experimenten loopt uit de hand wanneer hij zichzelf als proefkonijn gebruikt. Hij verandert in een aantrekkelijke maar kwaadaardige vrouw. Wanhopig probeert hij zijn dubbele identiteit te verbergen en vertelt hij de bewoners van het appartementsgebouw waar hij woont dat hij een zuster heeft, die hem sporadisch komt bezoeken. Over zijn alter ego heeft hij helaas geen controle meer en in de ongure straten van Londen worden steeds meer vrouwen op bloederige wijze vermoord.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"O Médico e a Irmã Monstro","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"杰凯尔博士和海德妹妹","overview":"在雾蒙蒙的伦敦，Jekyll博士对新近去世的女性进行实验，决心要发现一种长生不老的灵丹妙药。成功后，他可以壮观地变身成美丽但精神错乱的Hyde姐妹，她在怀特查佩尔的黑暗小巷中寻找年轻、无辜的女性受害者，以确保血腥研究的延续。随着每次变身，Hyde姐妹的支配性人格变得更加突出，决心最终永远压制那个脆弱无效的Jekyll博士。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Доктор Джекилл и сестра Хайд","overview":"19 век. Доктор Джекилл ищет панацею от всех болезней, своеобразный эликсир жизни. Он изобретает изменяющую пол микстуру, после чего трансформируется в молодую и привлекательную женщину. Он берет себе имя миссис Хайд и представляется сестрой Джекилла. Начинается борьба между двумя личностями...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"cs","iso_3166_1":"CZ","name":"Český","english_name":"Czech","title":"Doktor Jekyll a sestra Hyde","overview":"Kniha Roberta Louise Stevensona Podivný případ Dr. Jekylla a pana Hyda se dočkala velkého množství adaptací. Některé z nich jsou hodně neobvyklé, naše je ale ta z roku 1971, v níž se doktor Jekyll mění v sexy slečnu Hydeovou, která melouchaří jako Jack Rozparovač!","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"닥터 지킬 & 시스터 하이드","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ro","iso_3166_1":"RO","name":"Română","english_name":"Romanian","title":"Dr. Jekyll și sora Hyde","overview":"Dr. Henry Jekyll studiază longevitatea umană și, din greșeală, creează o formulă care-l transformă într-o femeie seducătoare și periculoasă.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"MX","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"Dr. Jekyll y su hermana Hyde","overview":"El Dr Jekyll experimenta en mujeres recién fallecidas, determinado a descubrir un elixir para la inmortalidad. En sus investigaciones, fabrica un brebaje que le convierte en una hermosa mujer, que se hace pasar por su hermana Hyde, y que se dedica a asesinar mujeres jóvenes para, de ese modo, poder continuar sus investigaciones como Jekyll. Sin embargo, con cada transformación, la hermana Hyde se convierte en la personalidad más dominante, dispuesta a suprimir al Dr. Jekyll para siempre.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"傑凱爾博士和海德妹妹","overview":"在霧濛濛的倫敦，Jekyll 博士對新近去世的女性進行實驗，決心要發現一種長生不老的靈丹妙藥。成功後，他可以壯觀地變身成美麗但精神錯亂的 Hyde 姐妹，她在懷特查佩爾的黑暗小巷中尋找年輕、無辜的女性受害者，以確保血腥研究的延續。隨著每次變身，Hyde 姐妹的支配性人格變得更加突出，決心最終永遠壓制那個脆弱無效的 Jekyll 博士。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ja","iso_3166_1":"JP","name":"日本語","english_name":"Japanese","title":"ジキル博士とハイド嬢","overview":"不老不死の研究を続けるジキル博士は、死体安置所の死体から女性ホルモンを抽出していた。やがて研究中の薬を、自分自身で試したジキル博士は、若く美しい女性ハイドに変身してしまう。ジキル博士は研究を続けるため、自ら死体を製造するべく、夜のロンドンをさまよい始めるが……。スティーヴンソンの『ジキル博士とハイド氏』を基にした、英ハマー・プロのエロチック・ホラー。","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"ylWRtdfcMLk","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"Dr. Jekyll And Sister Hyde (1971) - Official Trailer","iso_639_1":"en","official":true,"published_at":"2019-12-06T20:48:28.000Z","size":1080},{"key":"BPiN5aGi6Aw","site":"YouTube","type":"Featurette","name":"Joe Dante on DR. JEKYLL AND SISTER HYDE","iso_639_1":"en","official":false,"published_at":"2014-10-27T04:00:00.000Z","size":1080}],"images":{"posters":[{"file_path":"/mm3cm6hLHYwuB5bRim1PIM6guvN.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":1.562,"vote_count":8},{"file_path":"/8IrE2DPoMpOrbGgdpdIoKXFCvis.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/eKIi8mFkTqHwpVCraZbQnSjpCg.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":1.75,"vote_count":6},{"file_path":"/uYFiWFULvNDX5q6uyEMmMYe7oHx.jpg","width":1775,"height":2662,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":1.75,"vote_count":6},{"file_path":"/8wOpSZjxRW4GnSYqs5f7AgSBMsn.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":1.75,"vote_cou